<h1 class="chapter-title">12. The Truth Serum</h1>

<p class="first-para">The chaos was immediate and total. Patricia Okonkwo's voice echoed through the colony's intercom system, countermanding Chen's authority. "This is Chief of Staff Okonkwo. Governor Chen has been compromised. He is suffering from the same neurological condition affecting our colonists. I am assuming command under emergency protocols. All security personnel report to my location immediately."</p>

<p>Half the colony didn't know whom to believe. The other half had already taken sides. In the communications center, Chen turned to Elena, his face pale. "She's staging a coup."</p>

