<p>"Then we don't. We lock down the shuttle bay."</p>

<p>Chen nodded and began issuing orders through his personal comm unit, bypassing the compromised security network. He had enough loyalists scattered through the colony to make a difference—engineers, medical staff, old friends who had known him for years. They would not all follow Patricia's orders.</p>

<p>Elena's comm buzzed. It was Yuki Tanaka. "Dr. Vasquez, I've completed the electromagnetic device. I need a test subject."</p>

